# NOTE: the responsive image variants under public/_img/ and lib/image-manifest.json
# are generated by scripts/optimize-images.mjs but are deliberately COMMITTED, not
# ignored. Encoding them from scratch took ~40 minutes, which was the whole Vercel
# build — one deploy hit the 45-minute limit and failed. The script skips any source
# whose content hash is unchanged, so with the outputs in the repo a deploy encodes
# nothing and the build is just `next build`.
#
# Regenerate with `npm run optimize:images` after changing a source image, and commit
# the result. They still live in their own directory, so no filename pattern can
# confuse a generated file with a real source (e.g. public/certs/iso-9001-2015.webp).
